{
 "tutorial": "pi-rpi-gpio-connect-pir",
 "anchor": {
  "id": "pi",
  "type": "raspberry-pi-4-gpio",
  "how": "lock onto the breadboard: hole 1t.a is (0, 0) mm, x along the columns, y down the rows (the board's pins: Uno R3 shield layout)"
